  "StockRole": "Quicsell Gladiator",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Centurion is a venerable workhorse known for it's dependable service, weaponry and shield arm. This thing isn't a Centurion, not even close. Sure for Quicsell junk these might actually not break open after one hit but who let them even sell these things? I'm at a loss of words here boss. If you are looking for me I will be contemplating taking a walk outside the Argo without an Environmental suit on.",
